{"server":"cn","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_05_end","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_05","title":"熄灭过去的灯","storyCode":"EP-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"684da4a71248c465c84ba1dd9e9224b6586107dff7f59cf9fb362f92f9b96fae","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你们俩都到这个地步就不要再挣扎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怪我把你们交给审判庭，说到底我们都不是一路人，各为各的前程而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们愿意安静下来，我就拿开你们嘴里的布团。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（犹豫地点头）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不吵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你识相最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但鲁斯先生，你有没有想过，就算你们把我们和罗盘都交给审判庭，也不一定能有好结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们弟兄的尸体还挂在镇子外面的旗杆上发臭，你真觉得审判庭不会把你们也挂上去吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有......不在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死......那枚罗盘到底在哪里？那小子明明每晚炼完之后都会把罗盘送回这里......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在找这个吗，小哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该这个时候回来的，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我怎么觉得，自己回来得刚刚好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我......没有选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下你的刀，小哈，你的刀法都是我教给你的，对上我你没有丝毫胜算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我该试一试，你身上有伤，说不定打败你也不是那么困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，我不明白，究竟是怎样的不满让你与我走到这一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像今天这般，刀剑相向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从未对你有过不满，你所做的每个决定我都愿意支持，你的每个想法我都愿意赞同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我的母亲离开我，你牵起我的手，告诉我从此你就是我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时起，我对你就不会有任何不满了，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你又是为了什么呢，小哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了胡安娜......为了你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谎话，我就站在你面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，你要如何为了我而与我相敌对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的胡安娜，不会为了一己私欲让整个船队陷于危难，她是最英勇也最英明的首领，我们可以放心地跟从她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是我认识的胡安娜，你不过是一个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是一个为找寻往日激情，而忽视摆在面前的真实生活的可怜女人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"告诉过你很多次......\n海洋不是我们的过去，它是我们的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是你的一厢情愿，船队中已经没人再相信了。我们的父辈已经死去，从他们口中流传出的故事也该一同消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把罗盘给我，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管上前来，试试看你能不能拿到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜......你还不明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将罗盘交给审判庭可不是我一意孤行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一场哗变......原来等着我的是这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是惊喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想要罗盘，而他们也只想要一个安稳的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成全大家，你依然是我们的首领，什么都不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么都不会变？你真这么想吗，小哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再欺骗自己了，至少我对你的信任再也不会如往前一般。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是对的，胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领，别怪弟兄们，海里实在不是什么好去处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是想离开盐漠，好好过日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你们保证，只要放下你们手里的武器，回你们各自的帐篷，我会当这一切从未发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手吧，诸位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们谁都骗不了自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不好意思，我来晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啃鳞屎的，你这混球敢绑你姑奶奶，还想被放开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈维尔......你不是说这场哗变不会有人知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来的时候半路遇上鲁斯先生在盐漠里面“迷路”，我顺路带他回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈维尔，怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，可不敢来硬的喔，你朋友还在我们手里呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！我们的事情轮不到外人插话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是杀回去烧光镇子，拿回本来属于我们的东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一群人就为了个给审判庭下跪的鳞屎计划和大姐头在这里较劲？怂不怂啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈维尔，我们刚被他们杀了那么多弟兄，抢了那么多物资，你就着急带着所有人去认怂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜以前可不是这样教你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在是一群连食物都没有的伤兵残将，杀回去和送死有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，要不是这臭丫头带来了罗盘，那些审判庭经棍也不会来追杀我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，胡安娜女士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那把这丫头丢出去就够了，你们跟着投什么降？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，这不是办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，我们为什么还没把这丫头丢出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位，我有一些话想说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里没有你说话的份！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海盗的刀剑齐刷刷地指向帕斯卡拉，她冷汗直冒。\n帕斯卡拉咽咽口水，在裤子上蹭着手心的冷汗。\n她始终都清楚，想要的东西永远只能靠自己去争，去抢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，她就是一个小丫头，你们这是干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小红毛，你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，一屋子成年人想出来的唯一办法就是把一个孩子交出去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，小红毛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在为你说话哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我会为我自己说话的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友们，你们要把我交出去，我没有意见，真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你们要拿大拳头揍我，你们理解我拿劣质玩意儿蒙你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴力和虚伪，对，这就是我们活下去的办法......除了这个我们也找不到别的什么出路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......你们也知道那个镇子的实际情况，就算把我和罗盘交出去，你们的生活就能改善吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不交的话，审判庭那些经棍又会一直追杀我们，大家也还是没有好结果，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个死丫头到底要说什么？两条路在你嘴里都行不通！那要怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等一周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要一周，罗盘的修复就能有结果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，再给我些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他成功，我们可以跟着罗盘的指引去海上，那些经棍再也找不到我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他没成功，你们再把我交出去也来得及！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们人都在，我们也逃不出去的，再等一周又能怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亚，走出一片长不出粮食的土地，只会走进另一片长不出粮食的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在伊比利亚外面，如果没有钱，你的小命也不是你的！它属于给你钱的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士她当然不想带着大家一起死在海上......她图什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她多聪明，你们不清楚吗？她自己只会比你们每个人都混得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她可以成为你们每个人的大老板，给你们钱，再捏住你们的小命......但她没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是想让你们所有人都活得自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了罗盘，你们怎么就不能像你们的父辈一样，赚个盆满钵满？你们自称海盗，可你们谁见过海！别忘了自己是干什么的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说完，帕斯卡拉只觉得心脏几乎跳出胸膛，身上的衣服也被冷汗浸透。\n房间陷入寂静，她强装出尴尬的讪笑，回头看向身后的胡安娜、蒂奇、伊西多与极境。四人回以她肯定的眼神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是不是很有道理......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一周的话，我没意见，派人轮流盯着你们就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1588_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也没有意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船员们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，我不同意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这就被说动了？这就是个十多岁的小丫头保命的谎话，你们觉得她懂罗盘，还是懂航海？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你们保证，只要我们把罗盘抢到手！拿去交给审判庭！我们就能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"犹豫的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，哈维尔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一位船员放下武器，紧接着是另一位，人们陆陆续续走出了船长室。\n哈维尔和胡安娜，相对而立。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一项任务交给你和鲁斯，任务结束前你们不可回到船队，记住了吗，哈维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，去收拾行李吧，晚上你就该出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）哈维尔，走吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g12_alchemyworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成果如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一周的时限快要到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，我是说如果，我们失败了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可不能失败啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士为了支持你可是倾尽全力，想想她做的那些事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶走了哈维尔和鲁斯，哪怕那是她最得力的手下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至......甚至她还杀死了自己的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，帕斯卡拉，别说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他清楚该怎么做......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别在那里唉声叹气的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天就要有结果，难道你不着急吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急有什么用？想想以后，那只罗盘真的修好了，以后的日子是什么光景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，可如果失败的话......咱们又该怎么办？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天，那些船员几乎把外面堵了个严实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道为啥......我总有不好的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个时候就不要说丧气话了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实验最后几天，他总是拒绝我们的帮助，一个人躲起来进行实验......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就连今天，他也不愿意我们参与，只说实验复杂，需要精密的操作，所以不希望有人打扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但依我对他的了解......他这样做只是因为不想牵连别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能，他已经做好了失败的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可罗盘修复的流程不是还没结束吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺就是这样，做什么都会先预想最糟糕的结局，然后提前做好准备。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g12_alchemyworkshop"},{"type":"narration","text":"转瞬间，塑金台上层层叠叠的法术能量场悉数崩溃，刚刚还闪烁着金属光泽的物质已然化作焦黑的泥。\n千钧一发之际，伊西多眼疾手快将探针收起，才不至于损毁工具，但刚刚拼凑起的罗盘构件，都已支离破碎。\n拨弄着那摊黑泥，伊西多试图分析失败的原因。\n但那终归只是一摊黑泥，他先前倾注其中的所有自认为精巧的构思，都已不见踪迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我以为自己可以在这么短的时间里复制出来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明老师说过......即使技艺最精湛的炼金术师也要花十几年时间才能炼成心相原质......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锈蚀的心相原质依旧在他的衣袋里保持着静止，仿佛在嘲弄他的无能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"零件碎裂一地，青年颓坐在地，一切不言而喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，胡安娜女士，我失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，伊西多，这是我的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我愿意承担一切后果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g2_saltdesert_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这太冒险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听到消息了。那小子搞砸了，罗盘毁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就更不该去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭的条件是交出罗盘和盐船的设计图，你手里一样也没有。你拿什么去谈判？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们未必要把筹码直接交到他们手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以让他们亲自去取。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来更像是个讲道理的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想说我派来谈判的弟兄太野蛮，可以不用这么隐晦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我是想说你理应明白，信誉是合作的基础。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果我没有信誉，就不会亲自来见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两手空空地来见我，还要求我亲自进入盐漠，去取你承诺的筹码？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道那里会不会有百十个全副武装的强盗，等着我自投罗网？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有可能，我是在向你透露海盗据点的位置，告诉你，不仅能拿到罗盘和图纸，你还能驱使会驾驶盐船的船员？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g2_saltdesert_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，哈维尔，我们做这些是为了给弟兄们谋一条安稳的出路，不是为了让他们成为审判庭的囚徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总好过他们跟着一个没有罗盘的胡安娜，全都死在海里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，既然这个道理你明白我明白，弟兄们不会不明白。审判庭的人去的时候，他们会配合的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那胡安娜呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我承诺了额外的筹码，我也有额外的条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放过胡安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要亲自给我们带路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，执裁官阁下，谈判还没结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与我无关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您在想什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他绝不可能是诚心谈判，他所谓的据点，只会是一处陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再说一遍，我们的人手和资源条件不够进行一次大规模围剿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我手下的人状态都很好。你的人......我会确保他们能够出战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怀疑您的能力，但就算您能击败那些强盗，我们也承受不起更多伤亡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候就算拿到了图纸，我们也不剩什么可以造船的人手了。雅隆还是会继续被困在这片盐漠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的谈判，你的交易，与我无关。既然已经知晓强盗据点的位置，我就应当行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"强盗用于作孽的船，我会连同其图纸一并焚毁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些强盗......我会清除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有这个权力！你驱使的教士，是在雅隆出生长大的人，是和我共患难的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你却如此不了解他们......不，你已经背叛了他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还期望他们能听从你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
